	(text "SHEET 06 - DSI DISPLAY (PLAN.md sec.2)\nRaspberry Pi-standard 22-pin 0.5mm FFC on CM4 DSI1 - all 4 lanes wired so both 2-lane panels\n(e.g. 4.3in OSOYOO) and 4-lane panels (Touch Display 2) work; selection via device-tree overlay.\nPinout copied from CM4IO J16 (DISP1). Touch I2C = CM4 SDA0/SCL0 (pins 20/21), pulled to 3V3_CM4.\nDisplay 5V comes from the separate keyed connector J602 (or J301 on sheet 03) - not through the FFC.\nLAYOUT: 100R differential pairs, matched within pair, solid GND reference; keep < 100mm to connector."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 30 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "42d20972-09d2-509c-847d-93ef438025b8")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
